"T3DWindowTitle" "Order 34/k"
"T3DMessageText" "Warning! Don't proceed to the lower levels without permission!"
"T3DMessageText2" "Sublevels 2, 3, and 4 are contaminated with bugs - we're still awaiting further orders from Central Command."
"T3DMessageText3" "Lt. Williams and his men are missing, but we assume that at least some of them are still alive down there."
"T3DMessageText4" "Dawson - Friday/00.17"
